@startuml
' Component diagram: Dofus Retro bot platform (compact)

package "User Interface" {
  [Electron UI\n(Svelte)] as UI
  [Local CLI] as CLI
}

package "Orchestrator (Python - FastAPI)" {
  [FastAPI Orchestrator] as Orch
  database "SQLite (encrypted)" as DB
  [Scheduler] as Scheduler
  folder "plugins/" as Plugins
}

package "Core Engine (Rust)" {
  [MITM Proxy] as MITM
  [Packet Parser\nRust Engine] as Core
  [Lua VM\n(embedded)] as LuaVM
}

package "Sandbox Runners" {
  [Python Sandbox Runner\n(container/subprocess)] as PySandbox
  [UI Automation Worker\n(OpenCV + Input sim)] as UIWorker
}

UI --> Orch : HTTP/gRPC (control)
CLI --> Orch : CLI commands (local)
Orch --> DB : SQL (local)
Orch --> Scheduler : schedule requests
Orch --> PySandbox : RPC (Unix socket / gRPC)
Orch --> Core : IPC (gRPC / stdin-json)
Orch --> LuaVM : in-process call / binding
Core --> MITM : attach / inject packets
MITM --> "Dofus Client" : intercept packets
UIWorker --> "Dofus Client" : input simulation
Orch --> UIWorker : tasks (vision triggers)
Plugins --> Orch : local plugin files
Orch <---> UI : WebSocket for logs/telemetry (local-only)

note right of PySandbox
  Network: disabled by default
  Filesystem: restricted
end note

@enduml
